    "zh": "该产品为可降解型材，主要材质为PLA/PBS，适用于自动等应用场景，支持规格定制与批量供货。",
    "en": "This biodegradable profile is primarily made from PLA/PBS and is suitable for eco packaging and disposable use. Custom dimensions and bulk supply are supported."
  },
  "description": {
    "zh": [
      "可降解型材面向工业与消费品配套场景，可用于防护、包覆、导向和连接等需求。",
      "主要材质为PLA/PBS，可按项目要求匹配尺寸、壁厚、长度和结构形式，适配不同应用工况。",
      "包装与交付可按需求配置（如体积(cm³) 28125 / 37845 / 103428，宽(cm) 25 / 29 / 51，重量(g) 2700 / 3000 / 5000），支持稳定供货与长期项目协同。"
    ],
    "en": [
      "This biodegradable profile is designed for industrial and consumer assembly programs requiring protection, covering, guidance, and connection functions.",
      "The primary material is PLA/PBS, and dimensions such as outer diameter, wall thickness, length, and profile form can be aligned to project requirements.",
      "Packaging and delivery can be configured as needed (for example: Volume (cm³) 28125 / 37845 / 103428, (cm) 25 / 29 / 51, Weight (g) 2700 / 3000 / 5000), supporting stable supply and long-term project coordination."
    ]
  },
